[15.677532, "o", "# Chat channels leavedesk can post to.\r\npeople-ops:\r\n  purpose: Leave requests waiting for a decision, and anything the People team needs to see.\r\n  members: People team (5)\r\n  visibility: private\r\nteam-calendar:\r\n  purpose: Who is out and when, so teams can plan around absences.\r\n  members: Everyone at Quillmark, including contractors and agency staff (418)\r\n  visibility: public\r\n"]
